# UtsavSetu Implementation Plan — Independent Review Before Proceeding

## Overall verdict: Approve with revisions

I have reviewed your `implementation_plan.md` against the problems identified in the earlier UtsavSetu source-code review.

**The plan is well structured and addresses the right priorities. However, I recommend making several important changes before asking Google AI Studio to implement it.** The main risks are an overly broad promise of astronomical accuracy, a potentially misleading distinction between verified and unverified timings, and acceptance criteria that may be difficult to prove using the proposed tests alone.

The plan correctly prioritises four areas: reminder correctness, independent Panchang validation, UI/UX ergonomics, and release readiness. implementation_plan implementation_plan implementation_plan

My recommendation is to **retain the four-pass roadmap, revise the technical details below, and then implement incrementally in the existing Google AI Studio project**.

